    <comment>New package fff 0.9.4: libfff_c, the C ABI of the fff fuzzy file finder (Rust), linked against the distribution's libgit2. Lets opencode load the finder through bun:ffi instead of the copy inside the npm package.
INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage together: bun-pty, photon-node (new), opencode (requires this one at = 0.9.4).
Maintainer: pluskalm (package-level role set in devel:tools _meta).</comment>
